brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net a knot visualizer. user picks size N, site generates random permutations of [1..N]. these permutations are used to draw knots using petal projection (grid of them). then use some sort of energy relaxation to let the strings animate and look more like knots.

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@shimmermathlabs.com: early fluoddity user from 1884 investigating braid engineering with pen and paper

